{"base":"96251f128e2d0f5f58f05d5064672b37474ef409","description":"Prompt for passphrase on encrypted keys\n\nServe command silently failed when keystore was encrypted\nand RAD_PASSPHRASE was unset. Now checks encryption state\nand prompts interactively via inquire when needed.\n\n- Add passphrase_for_keystore: check is_encrypted, try env\n  var, fall back to interactive prompt\n- Extract prompt module from loose interactive functions\n- Add inquire as optional dep gated on share feature\n\n\nNarrow prompt module error types\n\nReturn error::Share directly from prompt functions\nso ? at call sites handles the conversion to\nRadArtifactError, removing double .into() chains.\n\n\nRemove unused Fetcher trait\n\n- Only one implementation (HttpFetcher) existed with no\n  prospect of a second URL-scheme fetcher\n- Trait didn't unify HTTP and iroh — iroh was already a\n  separate Location variant with dedicated functions\n- Inline HTTP logic as private fetch_http(), match scheme\n  directly in download(), drop fetchers parameter\n\n\nUse inquire::Select for interactive picker\n\nThe existing picker required typing numbers manually.\ninquire gives a better UX and is already a dependency.\n\n- Replace hand-rolled numbered list + stdin loop with\n  inquire::Select prompts for arrow-key navigation and\n  type-to-filter\n- Remove choice() helper and unused BufRead/Write imports\n- Use raw_prompt() for direct index access\n\n\nAdd --verbose to show and list commands\n\n- Render full CIDs and NodeIDs when --verbose is passed\n- Thread verbose flag through pretty() on Release and Releases\n- Add --verbose/-v to show command for consistency with list\n- Refactor format_did to accept full: bool instead of always truncating\n\n\nRender first & last 6 chars of cids in pretty mode\n\n\nFix location remove failing for non-delegates\n\n- Use find_unique_by_oid instead of find_delegate_release\n- Drop unused delegates param from location_remove\n- The COB state machine already enforces per-signer ownership,\n  so a delegate filter on remove was wrong","oid":"347e14b46f10a22453616cdcb563394e12f5c352","type":"revision"}